# Non-metric units, the imperial and US ones, by the groups of the unit
# picker (they are the `Non-Metric` sector there). Each
# is an exact multiple of an SI unit, and none takes a prefix; each row is a
# quantity and the same amount in a metric unit. A `°F` is converted as a
# temperature, with its offset.

# Inch `in`, foot `ft`, yard `yd`, mile `mi`, furlong `fur`, fathom `ftm`, `chain` and `rod`, and the `thou`.
sheet Length

Item   : String
Amount : Quantity
Same   : Quantity

| Item    | Amount | Same                |
| ------- | ------ | ------------------- |
| screw   | 5in    | = (5in).to('mm')    |
| door    | 7ft    | = (7ft).to('m')     |
| pitch   | 100yd  | = (100yd).to('m')   |
| hike    | 3mi    | = (3mi).to('km')    |
| race    | 8fur   | = (8fur).to('km')   |
| depth   | 6ftm   | = (6ftm).to('m')    |
| cricket | 1chain | = (1chain).to('m')  |
| fence   | 40rod  | = (40rod).to('m')   |
| gauge   | 10thou | = (10thou).to('um') |

# Ounce `oz`, pound `lb`, stone `st`, hundredweight `cwt`, short ton `ton`, long ton `lton`, grain `gr`, troy ounce `ozt`, pennyweight `dwt` and `slug`.
sheet Mass

Item   : String
Amount : Quantity
Same   : Quantity

| Item   | Amount | Same               |
| ------ | ------ | ------------------ |
| letter | 1oz    | = (1oz).to('g')    |
| bag    | 25lb   | = (25lb).to('kg')  |
| rider  | 11st   | = (11st).to('kg')  |
| coal   | 2cwt   | = (2cwt).to('kg')  |
| truck  | 20ton  | = (20ton).to('t')  |
| ship   | 1lton  | = (1lton).to('t')  |
| pellet | 15gr   | = (15gr).to('mg')  |
| gold   | 5ozt   | = (5ozt).to('g')   |
| ring   | 3dwt   | = (3dwt).to('g')   |
| engine | 2slug  | = (2slug).to('kg') |

# Square foot `ft^2`, `in^2` and `mi^2`, and the acre `ac`.
sheet Area

Item   : String
Amount : Quantity
Same   : Quantity

| Item   | Amount  | Same                  |
| ------ | ------- | --------------------- |
| room   | 200ft^2 | = (200ft^2).to('m^2') |
| tile   | 16in^2  | = (16in^2).to('cm^2') |
| county | 40mi^2  | = (40mi^2).to('km^2') |
| farm   | 160ac   | = (160ac).to('ha')    |

# Cubic foot `ft^3` and `in^3`, the US gallon `gal`, quart `qt`, pint `pt`, cup, `floz`, `tbsp` and `tsp`, the oil barrel `bbl`, the imperial `impgal` and `imppint`, and the `cord`.
sheet Volume

Item   : String
Amount : Quantity
Same   : Quantity

| Item    | Amount   | Same                  |
| ------- | -------- | --------------------- |
| freezer | 5ft^3    | = (5ft^3).to('l')     |
| engine  | 350in^3  | = (350in^3).to('l')   |
| tank    | 15gal    | = (15gal).to('l')     |
| milk    | 1qt      | = (1qt).to('ml')      |
| beer    | 1pt      | = (1pt).to('ml')      |
| rice    | 2cup     | = (2cup).to('ml')     |
| shot    | 1.5floz  | = (1.5floz).to('ml')  |
| spoon   | 2tbsp    | = (2tbsp).to('ml')    |
| dose    | 1tsp     | = (1tsp).to('ml')     |
| crude   | 1bbl     | = (1bbl).to('l')      |
| fuel    | 10impgal | = (10impgal).to('l')  |
| pub     | 1imppint | = (1imppint).to('ml') |
| wood    | 1cord    | = (1cord).to('m^3')   |

# Speed `mph` and `fps`, and an acceleration in `ft.s^-2`.
sheet Mechanical

Item   : String
Amount : Quantity
Same   : Quantity

| Item  | Amount        | Same                           |
| ----- | ------------- | ------------------------------ |
| road  | 60mph         | = (60mph).to('km.h^-1')        |
| pitch | 90mph         | = (90mph).to('m.s^-1')         |
| rifle | 2800fps       | = (2800fps).to('m.s^-1')       |
| fall  | 32.174ft.s^-2 | = (32.174ft.s^-2).to('m.s^-2') |

# Force `lbf` and `ozf`, pressure `psi`, energy `btu` and `therm`, torque `lbf.ft` and the mechanical horsepower `hp` (the metric one is `mhp`).
sheet Physical

Item   : String
Amount : Quantity
Same   : Quantity

| Item   | Amount   | Same                   |
| ------ | -------- | ---------------------- |
| thrust | 1000lbf  | = (1000lbf).to('kN')   |
| punch  | 8ozf     | = (8ozf).to('N')       |
| tyre   | 32psi    | = (32psi).to('kPa')    |
| heater | 12000btu | = (12000btu).to('MJ')  |
| gas    | 1therm   | = (1therm).to('MJ')    |
| wrench | 80lbf.ft | = (80lbf.ft).to('N.m') |
| engine | 200hp    | = (200hp).to('kW')     |

# The scales `°F` and `°R`.
sheet Thermal

Item   : String
Amount : Quantity
Same   : Quantity

| Item     | Amount | Same                | Back               | Check |
| -------- | ------ | ------------------- | ------------------ | ----- |
| boiling  | 212°F  | = (212°F).to('°C')  | =[*-1; *].to('ºC') | *     |
| freezing | 32°F   | = (32°F).to('K')    | =[*-1; *].to('ºF') | *     |
| body     | 98.6°F | = (98.6°F).to('°C') | =[*-1; *].to('ºF') | *     |
| zero     | 0°R    | = (0°R).to('K')     | =[*-1; *].to('ºR') | *     |
| room     | 68°F   | = (68°F).to('°C')   | =[*-1; *].to('ºF') | *     |

Check := Amount=~=Back

# The `pica` and the typographic `point` (a US pint is `pt`).
sheet Typographic

Item   : String
Amount : Quantity
Same   : Quantity

| Item   | Amount  | Same                 |
| ------ | ------- | -------------------- |
| column | 12pica  | = (12pica).to('mm')  |
| body   | 12point | = (12point).to('mm') |
| page   | 66pica  | = (66pica).to('in')  |
